<title>UK: APV says Siebe posts offer document.</title>
<headline>APV says Siebe posts offer document.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering company APV Plc said on Friday the document on the offer from control systems group Siebe Plc for APV was posted to shareholders on Thursday.</p>
<p>The first closing date for the 327.4 million stg bid is June 5, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Siebe is offering 0.10955 new shares in its company for each APV share valuing the target firm at about 105p a share. There is also a cash alternative of 97.5 pence per APV share.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
